---
alwaysApply: true
applyTo: *.tsx
---
**Naming markers.** Not too many, but a balanced count of interactive/structural HTML element carries semantic class markers for automated scraping:

| Prefix | Purpose | Example |
|---|---|---|
| `oo--<name>` | Specific / unique | `oo--site-sidebar`, `oo--home-hero`, `oo--map-legend` |
| `xx--<name>` | Functional / structural interactive / repeats | `xx--button`, `xx--select`, `xx--input`, `xx--hero` |